 "source": "recorded at JITFunction.run during the GPU suites test_fp8_paged_attn.py, test_nf4_route.py, test_nf4_gemv_bw.py and test_nf4_grouped.py (RTX A2000 sm_86, torch 2.8.0+cu128, triton 3.4.0, GNF4_TRITON_PREBIND=0), keeping only kernels the interpreter suites never launch",
